<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/17/msa@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memotong seksyen 3, 9, 10 dan 14. Kecualian"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/17/msa@> .
